.inc CoilcraftTemplates.lib

*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : ZC1818-AE
* Inductance = #VALUE!
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 0.1MHz-50MHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor Frequency Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt ZC1818-AE_freq port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=29pF Ind=8.2uH
X1 port1 port2 Model1A PARAMS:
+ R1=5
+ R2=0.006
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.000001
+ K2=1.04
+ K3= {Ind}
+ K4=0.011
+ K5=0.000009
+ L=0
+ Is=0
+ a=0
+ L_Z0=0
+ L_EL=0
+ L_F0=0E6
+ PkZ=3158.09623
.ends ZC1818-AE_freq

